<title>UK: Sole Brent cargo in chains kept by equity holder.</title>
<headline>Sole Brent cargo in chains kept by equity holder.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The one Brent cargo which turned physical on Tuesday was kept before the five o'clock deadline by the equity holder, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo, due to load in the October 23-25 range, was kept by British Petroleum. It had been due to load in the October 25-27 range but was advanced on Tuesday by two days.</p>
<p>The cargo was now offered for sale by BP, traders said.</p>
